  "description": "The TORPEDO step-through electric bicycle is designed to ensure you fully enjoy every riding experience. It features a throttle-based speed control function and is powered by a 48V 15Ah battery pack. With its adjustable 250W power output and dual hydraulic braking system, this e-bike delivers a smooth and comfortable ride—even on rugged terrain—thanks to the perfect combination of its 4.0\" x 20\" all-terrain tires, spring-suspension front fork, and high-strength rear suspension springs. Offering four distinct speed modes and a top speed of 25 km/h, this e-bike effortlessly handles a wide variety of riding scenarios. A full charge takes just 5 to 6 hours, providing an impressive range of up to 90 KM. Its foldable design allows for easy storage, even in tight spaces.",
